# Crawler

## Allowlist

- Support only an explicit, small allowlist of sites.
- Route via `dispatch.py` (site → parser lookup). Do not scrape arbitrary hosts.

## Fetch / parse rules

- Crawl **only** the given URL. Never follow links found on the page.
- Use `httpx` (async) + BeautifulSoup with `lxml`.

## Site parsers (`crawler/sites/`)

- One module per site.
- Expected shape: input URL (and/or HTML) → job-fields dict matching `jobs` sheet columns (`job_title`, `job_description`, `job_location`, `job_company`, `job_salary`, `job_type`, `job_posted_date`, etc.).
- Add new sites as new modules; register them in the dispatch allowlist.
